I think that is something that you don't really get in the uk it's completely incomparable to being at home.
她觉得，在英国很少有这样的体验，和待在自己家乡完全不能相比。

9
00:00:41,119 --> 00:00:48,759
Or even like places in Europe and the west people don't offer you the same level of kindness just dayto day kindness.
她又拿欧洲和西方一些地方作比较，说自己没有得到过同样程度的日常善意。

10
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:55,040
Yeah and I think this snorts came across especially when we were in karach looking for food recommendations.
另一位说，这点在他们到当地寻找美食推荐时尤其明显；字幕中的地名与前面一词待核验。

11
